(6448289, 957665, 83650, '<td valign="top">Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 10<br/>The first thing that jumped out at me was major jaggies in the light streaks. Not sure if that was from your sharpening method or not. Try masking those off when sharpening to give a more smooth appearance.</td>', 'Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 10The first thing that jumped out at me was major jaggies in the light streaks. Not sure if that was from your sharpening method or not. Try masking those off when sharpening to give a more smooth appearance.', '2011-06-20 10:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448290, 956923, 83650, '<td valign="top">Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 3<br/>Yes, there''s some branch movement.  But it''s certainly not a shot that couldn''t have been done handheld in a windy situation.</td>', 'Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 3Yes, there''s some branch movement.  But it''s certainly not a shot that couldn''t have been done handheld in a windy situation.', '2011-06-20 11:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
