(6448476, 957609, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting minimalism to this photo. The watch seems to be pointed away from the emptiness.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: For me, it''s very low. With the amount of light in the image, it seems very possible to take this handheld. I do see the slight ghosting of the second hand indicating that it''s a long exposure, but I wonder how many voters will completely miss that.</td>', 'Interesting minimalism to this photo. The watch seems to be pointed away from the emptiness. Obvious tripod use: For me, it''s very low. With the amount of light in the image, it seems very possible to take this handheld. I do see the slight ghosting of the second hand indicating that it''s a long exposure, but I wonder how many voters will completely miss that.', '2011-06-20 14:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
