(6448583, 957593, 83650, '<td valign="top">Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 10<br/>Light trails from bus and headlights from cars + sharp architectural surroundings shows a tripod was used.</td>', 'Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 10Light trails from bus and headlights from cars + sharp architectural surroundings shows a tripod was used.', '2011-06-20 15:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448587, 957319, 83650, '<td valign="top">Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 3<br/>If the exposure was lengthened to another second or two, the waves/water would have been more smooth.  This just *feels* like a ~1/2sec exposure, something that could have been done handheld with steady hands/arms.</td>', 'Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 3If the exposure was lengthened to another second or two, the waves/water would have been more smooth.  This just *feels* like a ~1/2sec exposure, something that could have been done handheld with steady hands/arms.', '2011-06-20 15:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448588, 957633, 83650, '<td valign="top">Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 3<br/>Without knowing what I''m looking at, it''s very hard to tell if this is something that required a tripod to accomplish.</td>', 'Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 3Without knowing what I''m looking at, it''s very hard to tell if this is something that required a tripod to accomplish.', '2011-06-20 15:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448590, 957543, 83650, '<td valign="top">Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 5<br/>Although a tripod was likely used, doing this shot handheld with a couple of strong light sources could have been done as well.</td>', 'Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 5Although a tripod was likely used, doing this shot handheld with a couple of strong light sources could have been done as well.', '2011-06-20 15:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448591, 957626, 83650, '<td valign="top">Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 2<br/>There''s nothing here that tells me that this couldn''t have been shot handheld.</td>', 'Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 2There''s nothing here that tells me that this couldn''t have been shot handheld.', '2011-06-20 15:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448593, 957152, 83650, '<td valign="top">Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 5<br/>A good telephoto lens with a high ISO, handheld?  It''s possible.  Star trails with the moon would have been a dead giveaway.</td>', 'Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 5A good telephoto lens with a high ISO, handheld?  It''s possible.  Star trails with the moon would have been a dead giveaway.', '2011-06-20 15:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448594, 956892, 83650, '<td valign="top">Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 10<br/>Sharp rocks and lighthouse with misty/foggy waves.  All telltale signs of a tripod.</td>', 'Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 10Sharp rocks and lighthouse with misty/foggy waves.  All telltale signs of a tripod.', '2011-06-20 15:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448596, 957669, 83650, '<td valign="top">Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 10<br/>Nice sharp objects and buildings. Silky smooth water. Mission accomplished</td>', 'Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 10Nice sharp objects and buildings. Silky smooth water. Mission accomplished', '2011-06-20 15:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448598, 957164, 83650, '<td valign="top">Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 9<br/>The excessively blown out street lamps and the faint ghosting of a couple walking on the right shows this wasn''t done handheld.</td>', 'Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 9The excessively blown out street lamps and the faint ghosting of a couple walking on the right shows this wasn''t done handheld.', '2011-06-20 15:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448599, 957591, 83650, '<td valign="top">Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 4<br/>If it was very windy, this could have been done handheld with a slow-ish exposure time.(1/2 sec?)</td>', 'Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 4If it was very windy, this could have been done handheld with a slow-ish exposure time.(1/2 sec?)', '2011-06-20 15:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448611, 957615, 60173, '<td valign="top">My first thought, "Well, that''s not good". Cool result.</td>', 'My first thought, "Well, that''s not good". Cool result.', '2011-06-20 16:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448630, 957164, 130147, '<td valign="top"><u></u></td>', '', '2011-06-20 17:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448637, 957568, 114225, '<td valign="top">An interesting pop of color in the scene. I''m not too keen on the halo effect surrounding branches.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: To me, it''s low. This shot, while it looks like it may be done later in the day, feels well enough lit to be doable handheld.</td>', 'An interesting pop of color in the scene. I''m not too keen on the halo effect surrounding branches. Obvious tripod use: To me, it''s low. This shot, while it looks like it may be done later in the day, feels well enough lit to be doable handheld.', '2011-06-20 17:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448640, 957325, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Seems like it could be telling us a story, but what? Looks like one participant has some karate robes on, so is it some sort of class?<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: The tripod in the shot itself is very obvious. So on that front it meets perfectly. For the camera taking the overall photo, that could have definitely been done without a tripod. At first, I didn''t really see the tripod in the shot, so you may get some people wondering how this fits the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Seems like it could be telling us a story, but what? Looks like one participant has some karate robes on, so is it some sort of class? Obvious tripod use: The tripod in the shot itself is very obvious. So on that front it meets perfectly. For the camera taking the overall photo, that could have definitely been done without a tripod. At first, I didn''t really see the tripod in the shot, so you may get some people wondering how this fits the challenge.', '2011-06-20 17:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448644, 957523, 114225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors in the sky. I''m not sure if this is the shape of the clouds, but I''m detecting a lot of noise in the sky, which is bringing the quality of the image down a bit.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: Medium. I bet that''s a shock! Why do I say medium? It''s because of the amount of light in the sky, and the very few stars in the sky. This looks like it could be a fast enough exposure using high iso (remember the noise that I was detecting) to be handheld. I''m sure it''s done with a tripod, but I wanted to give you my gut feel.</td>', 'Beautiful colors in the sky. I''m not sure if this is the shape of the clouds, but I''m detecting a lot of noise in the sky, which is bringing the quality of the image down a bit. Obvious tripod use: Medium. I bet that''s a shock! Why do I say medium? It''s because of the amount of light in the sky, and the very few stars in the sky. This looks like it could be a fast enough exposure using high iso (remember the noise that I was detecting) to be handheld. I''m sure it''s done with a tripod, but I wanted to give you my gut feel.', '2011-06-20 17:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448652, 956858, 114225, '<td valign="top">There have been a number of similar entries lately, cut they are always a joy to look at.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: Very high.</td>', 'There have been a number of similar entries lately, cut they are always a joy to look at. Obvious tripod use: Very high.', '2011-06-20 17:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
