(6448876, 957661, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool cloud formations. The highlights are a bit blown out, which in my mind is hurting the photo somewhat.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: For me, it''s low. The lighting for this photo with the silhouettes lends itself to fast-ish shutter speeds. I do see the blur in the movement of the  foreground plant, but I''m not so sure that people who don''t study the photo will see that.</td>', 'Very cool cloud formations. The highlights are a bit blown out, which in my mind is hurting the photo somewhat. Obvious tripod use: For me, it''s low. The lighting for this photo with the silhouettes lends itself to fast-ish shutter speeds. I do see the blur in the movement of the  foreground plant, but I''m not so sure that people who don''t study the photo will see that.', '2011-06-20 22:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448877, 957338, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very very cute idea. I may just have to steal that idea when my kid is born.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: High.</td>', 'Very very cute idea. I may just have to steal that idea when my kid is born. Obvious tripod use: High.', '2011-06-20 22:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448881, 957656, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool view. I like how this is framed so that we feel in the middle of the photo.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: Very low. I only see very very slight blurring in the water. With a nice long exposure the water could have had a milky smooth feel that would have indicated the need for a tripod much better.</td>', 'Cool view. I like how this is framed so that we feel in the middle of the photo. Obvious tripod use: Very low. I only see very very slight blurring in the water. With a nice long exposure the water could have had a milky smooth feel that would have indicated the need for a tripod much better.', '2011-06-20 22:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448902, 957618, 117534, '<td valign="top">Beautiful hdr..</td>', 'Beautiful hdr..', '2011-06-20 23:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448905, 957469, 117534, '<td valign="top">Very nice.. Hey maybe you can answer this question, I recently did a star trail pic, and my stars are all diff colors like yours, Why? Are stars really different colors?</td>', 'Very nice.. Hey maybe you can answer this question, I recently did a star trail pic, and my stars are all diff colors like yours, Why? Are stars really different colors?', '2011-06-20 23:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
