(6448917, 957609, 117534, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph</td>', 'Beautiful photograph', '2011-06-20 23:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448918, 957596, 117534, '<td valign="top">Seriously is that inside a marble? Freakin'' coooool</td>', 'Seriously is that inside a marble? Freakin'' coooool', '2011-06-20 23:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448919, 957336, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice street photography with a lot of colors, although I find myself wondering what black and white would look like.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: Low to None. Yes, I do see the slight hand movement, but that''s not nearly enough to indicate that this required a tripod to be taken.</td>', 'Nice street photography with a lot of colors, although I find myself wondering what black and white would look like. Obvious tripod use: Low to None. Yes, I do see the slight hand movement, but that''s not nearly enough to indicate that this required a tripod to be taken.', '2011-06-20 23:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448920, 957256, 117534, '<td valign="top">Holy Buckets this is Beautiful!!!</td>', 'Holy Buckets this is Beautiful!!!', '2011-06-20 23:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448922, 956858, 117534, '<td valign="top">Love how the background looks like the edge of the world!</td>', 'Love how the background looks like the edge of the world!', '2011-06-20 23:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448924, 957620, 117534, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors</td>', 'beautiful colors', '2011-06-20 23:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448925, 957529, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice effect. I swear that is what it would look like if someone photographed me sleeping.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: Very high.</td>', 'Nice effect. I swear that is what it would look like if someone photographed me sleeping. Obvious tripod use: Very high.', '2011-06-20 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448928, 957588, 117534, '<td valign="top">Very Nice!!!!</td>', 'Very Nice!!!!', '2011-06-20 23:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448929, 957670, 117534, '<td valign="top">Stunning landscape!!!!</td>', 'Stunning landscape!!!!', '2011-06-20 23:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448930, 957649, 117534, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors and love the leading line</td>', 'Pretty colors and love the leading line', '2011-06-20 23:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448939, 957630, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo with great use of sepia toning.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: Low. looks like there might be an ever so slight blur in the leaves in the upper left, but that''s not enough to say that this shot required a tripod to me. I''m not saying that you didn''t use one, just that the use of a tripod is far from obvious.</td>', 'Very cool photo with great use of sepia toning. Obvious tripod use: Low. looks like there might be an ever so slight blur in the leaves in the upper left, but that''s not enough to say that this shot required a tripod to me. I''m not saying that you didn''t use one, just that the use of a tripod is far from obvious.', '2011-06-20 23:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448941, 957621, 114225, '<td valign="top">Aliens do exist! This is proof! :) I really appreciate the creativity.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: Medium-low. I can see movement in the clouds/fog, but I''m really not seeing enough to make the tripod requirement obvious.</td>', 'Aliens do exist! This is proof! :) I really appreciate the creativity. Obvious tripod use: Medium-low. I can see movement in the clouds/fog, but I''m really not seeing enough to make the tripod requirement obvious.', '2011-06-20 23:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448946, 957144, 114225, '<td valign="top">It''s so difficult to get these moon photos during the clouds. To our eyes it looks amazing. The result from a camera is always uninspiring (unless you make a composite).<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: Medium. I''m certain you did use a tripod, but the obvious need isn''t fully there. The reason is the clouds are fairly static looking instead of showing movement across the area.</td>', 'It''s so difficult to get these moon photos during the clouds. To our eyes it looks amazing. The result from a camera is always uninspiring (unless you make a composite). Obvious tripod use: Medium. I''m certain you did use a tripod, but the obvious need isn''t fully there. The reason is the clouds are fairly static looking instead of showing movement across the area.', '2011-06-20 23:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448947, 957616, 114225, '<td valign="top">It''s unfortunate that high ISO is causing the noise in the upper right. That is really distracting me away from the beautiful silhouette.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: High.</td>', 'It''s unfortunate that high ISO is causing the noise in the upper right. That is really distracting me away from the beautiful silhouette. Obvious tripod use: High.', '2011-06-20 23:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448950, 957556, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very well done. Every time I have tried something like this I failed miserably, so I know the difficulty in getting this right.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: High.</td>', 'Very well done. Every time I have tried something like this I failed miserably, so I know the difficulty in getting this right. Obvious tripod use: High.', '2011-06-21 00:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448953, 957679, 132996, '<td valign="top">That sure is an intense sky! Possibly could have used a second layer to lighten the foreground, but otherwise, very impressive storm.</td>', 'That sure is an intense sky! Possibly could have used a second layer to lighten the foreground, but otherwise, very impressive storm.', '2011-06-21 00:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448955, 956931, 132996, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous long exposure. I like the little sprouts on the rock!</td>', 'Gorgeous long exposure. I like the little sprouts on the rock!', '2011-06-21 00:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448956, 957490, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great tones in this image. I seem to detect a hint of cyan which adds to the water.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: High.</td>', 'Great tones in this image. I seem to detect a hint of cyan which adds to the water. Obvious tripod use: High.', '2011-06-21 00:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448957, 957587, 132996, '<td valign="top">Amazing. The headlights perfectly illuminated the side of the road and the combination of the red and yellow really makes this fiery. Great use of complementary colors also: red and green.</td>', 'Amazing. The headlights perfectly illuminated the side of the road and the combination of the red and yellow really makes this fiery. Great use of complementary colors also: red and green.', '2011-06-21 00:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448960, 957501, 132996, '<td valign="top">Wow, this isn''t something you see everyday. Instead of using the typical car-light long exposure. You use a plane. Excellent. I love how you can see the stars also.</td>', 'Wow, this isn''t something you see everyday. Instead of using the typical car-light long exposure. You use a plane. Excellent. I love how you can see the stars also.', '2011-06-21 00:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6448963, 957462, 132996, '<td valign="top">43 minutes...wow. The effect is stunning. A lot of those birds must have been sitting there for a while!</td>', '43 minutes...wow. The effect is stunning. A lot of those birds must have been sitting there for a while!', '2011-06-21 00:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
