(6449388, 957536, 83650, '<td valign="top">Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 5<br/>Tough one.  Fast lens, high ISO?  On second thought, the starbursts from the lights say smaller aperture.  F13/F16 maybe?  Ok, you used a tripod. :-)</td>', 'Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 5Tough one.  Fast lens, high ISO?  On second thought, the starbursts from the lights say smaller aperture.  F13/F16 maybe?  Ok, you used a tripod. :-)', '2011-06-21 16:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
