(6449417, 957672, 83650, '<td valign="top">Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 2<br/>It''s obvious a fast shutter speed was used here due to the water droplets being suspended in animation.  A more soft flowing water stream, while the subject holds his pose, would have been more convincing.</td>', 'Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 2It''s obvious a fast shutter speed was used here due to the water droplets being suspended in animation.  A more soft flowing water stream, while the subject holds his pose, would have been more convincing.', '2011-06-21 17:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
