(6449422, 957640, 83650, '<td valign="top">Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 5<br/>This shot is almost right on the border of being handheld.  Stiff arms and hands could almost pull this off.  If you would have increased the exposure time by at least a couple seconds, the waterfalls and pool would have been a little more smooth.  Your jpg compression doesn''t help the surrounding rocks either - they look like you flinched. :-)</td>', 'Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 5This shot is almost right on the border of being handheld.  Stiff arms and hands could almost pull this off.  If you would have increased the exposure time by at least a couple seconds, the waterfalls and pool would have been a little more smooth.  Your jpg compression doesn''t help the surrounding rocks either - they look like you flinched. :-)', '2011-06-21 17:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
