(6449437, 957501, 83650, '<td valign="top">Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 10<br/>Very unique shot I have to say.  I don''t believe I''ve seen this one done before on DPC.</td>', 'Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 10Very unique shot I have to say.  I don''t believe I''ve seen this one done before on DPC.', '2011-06-21 17:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449438, 957331, 83650, '<td valign="top">Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 10<br/>Perfect light trails and sharp stationary objects show a tripod had to be used.</td>', 'Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 10Perfect light trails and sharp stationary objects show a tripod had to be used.', '2011-06-21 17:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449440, 957656, 83650, '<td valign="top">Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 1<br/>Nothing in this shot says tripod to me.  The water is choppy and not smooth and the clouds appear stationary as well.  If this was done on a tripod, it could have been done handheld as well.</td>', 'Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 1Nothing in this shot says tripod to me.  The water is choppy and not smooth and the clouds appear stationary as well.  If this was done on a tripod, it could have been done handheld as well.', '2011-06-21 17:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449441, 957332, 83650, '<td valign="top">Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 10<br/>I had to look closely, but I can see the light trails from cars driving by on the bridge and elsewhere.</td>', 'Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 10I had to look closely, but I can see the light trails from cars driving by on the bridge and elsewhere.', '2011-06-21 17:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449442, 957614, 83650, '<td valign="top">Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 1<br/>Nothing is evident to me that this was taken with a tripod.  It could have easily been done handheld.</td>', 'Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 1Nothing is evident to me that this was taken with a tripod.  It could have easily been done handheld.', '2011-06-21 17:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449443, 957239, 16106, '<td valign="top">A bit more time and hence blur would have helped isolate the moving versus the static components, and made both a stronger image and a better entry for the challenge.</td>', 'A bit more time and hence blur would have helped isolate the moving versus the static components, and made both a stronger image and a better entry for the challenge.', '2011-06-21 17:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449444, 957572, 83650, '<td valign="top">Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): *<br/>*I''m not sure of the point of this photo.</td>', 'Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): **I''m not sure of the point of this photo.', '2011-06-21 17:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449445, 956858, 83650, '<td valign="top">Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 10<br/>Starbursts all over the place show a small aperture was used.  Couple that with nighttime, and this had to be done with a longer exposure.</td>', 'Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 10Starbursts all over the place show a small aperture was used.  Couple that with nighttime, and this had to be done with a longer exposure.', '2011-06-21 17:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449446, 956931, 83650, '<td valign="top">Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 10<br/>Nice smooth water and sharp surroundings.</td>', 'Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 10Nice smooth water and sharp surroundings.', '2011-06-21 17:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449447, 957556, 83650, '<td valign="top">Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 10<br/>Nice unique shot.  Looks like a big slide!</td>', 'Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 10Nice unique shot.  Looks like a big slide!', '2011-06-21 17:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449448, 957338, 83650, '<td valign="top">Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 10<br/>Light painting with a still child.  Had to be a tripod involved in this one!</td>', 'Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 10Light painting with a still child.  Had to be a tripod involved in this one!', '2011-06-21 17:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449453, 957593, 16106, '<td valign="top">I have seen similar images on line with the arch completed, and a bit more of the first tower in the image. I''m not sure if I''m missing that part of the image because it is inherently better image, or because I expected it to be there. Otherwise it is a strong image.</td>', 'I have seen similar images on line with the arch completed, and a bit more of the first tower in the image. I''m not sure if I''m missing that part of the image because it is inherently better image, or because I expected it to be there. Otherwise it is a strong image.', '2011-06-21 17:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449455, 957587, 16106, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, well executed, my pick for blue. I do wish you had flashed the bike somewhere along the way to clear up the mystery of what was causing the trail.</td>', 'Clever idea, well executed, my pick for blue. I do wish you had flashed the bike somewhere along the way to clear up the mystery of what was causing the trail.', '2011-06-21 17:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449456, 957670, 16106, '<td valign="top">very nice composition, well framed and well found. Ought to ribbon, I do wish there was a true black in the frame to give it a bit more pop.</td>', 'very nice composition, well framed and well found. Ought to ribbon, I do wish there was a true black in the frame to give it a bit more pop.', '2011-06-21 17:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449457, 956931, 16106, '<td valign="top">Beautifully presented, my only issue is the strong diagonal division of the frame, with nothing but water to keep the eye from wandering off the frame in the lower left. Top 3.</td>', 'Beautifully presented, my only issue is the strong diagonal division of the frame, with nothing but water to keep the eye from wandering off the frame in the lower left. Top 3.', '2011-06-21 17:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449458, 957462, 16106, '<td valign="top">Lovely and evocative, one of those that could ribbon and win a Postumous.</td>', 'Lovely and evocative, one of those that could ribbon and win a Postumous.', '2011-06-21 17:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449461, 957331, 16106, '<td valign="top">This is just great, the shifting position of the waiting girl in the foreground makes the image go from good to very good.</td>', 'This is just great, the shifting position of the waiting girl in the foreground makes the image go from good to very good.', '2011-06-21 17:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449463, 957338, 16106, '<td valign="top">Sweet and simple. The softness of the light on the child''s face works perfectly with his sleeping features.</td>', 'Sweet and simple. The softness of the light on the child''s face works perfectly with his sleeping features.', '2011-06-21 17:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449520, 957523, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great stratified colors. RGB. Well done getting those stars to pop so crisply. Personally I would have taken a bit of blur brush to the green and blue (and a bit of the red) to reduce the noise. It would have preserved the sharp stars while smoothing the entire image. But of course I also rarely know what I''m talking about. Great stuff.</td>', 'Great stratified colors. RGB. Well done getting those stars to pop so crisply. Personally I would have taken a bit of blur brush to the green and blue (and a bit of the red) to reduce the noise. It would have preserved the sharp stars while smoothing the entire image. But of course I also rarely know what I''m talking about. Great stuff.', '2011-06-21 19:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449523, 957256, 64446, '<td valign="top">Most beautiful and exquisite location, so well captured!</td>', 'Most beautiful and exquisite location, so well captured!', '2011-06-21 19:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449524, 957588, 64446, '<td valign="top">Love the HDR! Great image... makes keep me looking...</td>', 'Love the HDR! Great image... makes keep me looking...', '2011-06-21 19:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449526, 957615, 64446, '<td valign="top">Most interesting effect! Hope you''ll share... Great image!</td>', 'Most interesting effect! Hope you''ll share... Great image!', '2011-06-21 19:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449527, 957670, 38930, '<td valign="top">Awesome location and great title</td>', 'Awesome location and great title', '2011-06-21 19:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449528, 957560, 38930, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is great! Adding to fav''s</td>', 'Wow, this is great! Adding to fav''s', '2011-06-21 19:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449530, 957543, 64446, '<td valign="top">No doubt, with a tripod. Love how timely you got the drop just touching the surface. The color variety is just a great and completes the image nicely.</td>', 'No doubt, with a tripod. Love how timely you got the drop just touching the surface. The color variety is just a great and completes the image nicely.', '2011-06-21 19:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449531, 957447, 38930, '<td valign="top">There''s so much to look at here, and the house is so crisp and perfectly exposed. Very nice!</td>', 'There''s so much to look at here, and the house is so crisp and perfectly exposed. Very nice!', '2011-06-21 19:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449534, 957640, 38930, '<td valign="top">I thought this was pretty small until I saw the heron! It adds great scale and really helps the picture in a nice way</td>', 'I thought this was pretty small until I saw the heron! It adds great scale and really helps the picture in a nice way', '2011-06-21 19:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449535, 957587, 38930, '<td valign="top">The headlights at the end are a very nice touch</td>', 'The headlights at the end are a very nice touch', '2011-06-21 19:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449536, 957607, 38930, '<td valign="top">Nice detail shot</td>', 'Nice detail shot', '2011-06-21 19:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449537, 957597, 38930, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a great location!!</td>', 'Wow, what a great location!!', '2011-06-21 19:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449538, 957618, 38930, '<td valign="top">Nice place you have here :)</td>', 'Nice place you have here :)', '2011-06-21 19:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449539, 957656, 38930, '<td valign="top">Awesome location!</td>', 'Awesome location!', '2011-06-21 19:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449540, 957501, 64446, '<td valign="top">Rio!! Just now I spotted it! Nice composition and effect. Amazing how clear skies you got, with so much details. Well done, and thank you for sharing the view...</td>', 'Rio!! Just now I spotted it! Nice composition and effect. Amazing how clear skies you got, with so much details. Well done, and thank you for sharing the view...', '2011-06-21 19:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449560, 957604, 114565, '<td valign="top">Hey, thats Frankston Pier, Do you live there? I am in S.Frankston!</td>', 'Hey, thats Frankston Pier, Do you live there? I am in S.Frankston!', '2011-06-21 20:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449566, 957336, 103818, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at this for awhile, not sure if I''m missing something but I can''t tell why this is an obvious tripod.</td>', 'I''ve looked at this for awhile, not sure if I''m missing something but I can''t tell why this is an obvious tripod.', '2011-06-21 20:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449569, 957674, 103818, '<td valign="top">Awesome concept!</td>', 'Awesome concept!', '2011-06-21 20:47:29.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6449588, 957566, 92577, '<td valign="top">would also do well in the current sepia challenge - good luck</td>', 'would also do well in the current sepia challenge - good luck', '2011-06-21 21:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449716, 957043, 94815, '<td valign="top">I''m giving this a 6 based on pure technical skill (HDR?) even though I can''t see any obvious use of a tripod except to keep the camera out of the mud.</td>', 'I''m giving this a 6 based on pure technical skill (HDR?) even though I can''t see any obvious use of a tripod except to keep the camera out of the mud.', '2011-06-21 23:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449726, 956923, 94815, '<td valign="top">Good woods and arty blurs.</td>', 'Good woods and arty blurs.', '2011-06-21 23:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449728, 957490, 94815, '<td valign="top">The cool tones suit the subject.</td>', 'The cool tones suit the subject.', '2011-06-21 23:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449733, 957256, 94815, '<td valign="top">In my experience it is quite rare to capture the grandeur of such a scene but you''ve done it. The trees help the scale but I think it''s the light and well managed processing to let it glow, so to speak, that makes it work. The long exposure and misty air add an atmospheric perspective that clinches it. Nearly a perfect 10.</td>', 'In my experience it is quite rare to capture the grandeur of such a scene but you''ve done it. The trees help the scale but I think it''s the light and well managed processing to let it glow, so to speak, that makes it work. The long exposure and misty air add an atmospheric perspective that clinches it. Nearly a perfect 10.', '2011-06-21 23:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449742, 957152, 114225, '<td valign="top">It''s aways nice when there is color in the moon. Adds a little extra flare.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: Medium. I''m sure you used a tripod for this, but I also know that it''s totally possible to shoot this without a a tripod. With a full moon at f/5.6 your shutter speed could be as high as 1/200 (I''m even thinking low iso) which is definitely hand holdable.</td>', 'It''s aways nice when there is color in the moon. Adds a little extra flare. Obvious tripod use: Medium. I''m sure you used a tripod for this, but I also know that it''s totally possible to shoot this without a a tripod. With a full moon at f/5.6 your shutter speed could be as high as 1/200 (I''m even thinking low iso) which is definitely hand holdable.', '2011-06-22 00:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449744, 957332, 114225, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous tones in this image. I especially like how the bursts of red really stick out and how the bridge leads us into the view.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use:  High. I wonder if you will get any comments from people thinking a tripod isn''t needed, if if they say that, then they likely didn''t see the light streaks from cars.</td>', 'Gorgeous tones in this image. I especially like how the bursts of red really stick out and how the bridge leads us into the view. Obvious tripod use:  High. I wonder if you will get any comments from people thinking a tripod isn''t needed, if if they say that, then they likely didn''t see the light streaks from cars.', '2011-06-22 00:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449745, 957494, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very eery coloring in the sky. Gives a real sense of wonder and anxiousness.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: High. I was about to put medium high, but then I was thinking back to some recent photos I attempted similar to this, and I know that to get this much silhouette you need a pretty long shutter.</td>', 'Very eery coloring in the sky. Gives a real sense of wonder and anxiousness. Obvious tripod use: High. I was about to put medium high, but then I was thinking back to some recent photos I attempted similar to this, and I know that to get this much silhouette you need a pretty long shutter.', '2011-06-22 00:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449746, 957319, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the three splits of color. Gives distinct borders to the image that are then blurred (no pun intended) by the seagulls.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: High.</td>', 'I like the three splits of color. Gives distinct borders to the image that are then blurred (no pun intended) by the seagulls. Obvious tripod use: High.', '2011-06-22 00:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449749, 957668, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective for a water fall style shot. It took me a bit to figure out what I was looking at. I fear that speed voters may not take the time to appreciate it.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: High.</td>', 'Interesting perspective for a water fall style shot. It took me a bit to figure out what I was looking at. I fear that speed voters may not take the time to appreciate it. Obvious tripod use: High.', '2011-06-22 00:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449751, 957536, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition, especially the silhouetted building in the background of the right.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: high.</td>', 'Wonderful composition, especially the silhouetted building in the background of the right. Obvious tripod use: high.', '2011-06-22 00:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449753, 957673, 114225, '<td valign="top">Lovely lines to this photo. The horizon is very badly tilted, which is ruining the cleanliness of the image for me.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: Very high.</td>', 'Lovely lines to this photo. The horizon is very badly tilted, which is ruining the cleanliness of the image for me. Obvious tripod use: Very high.', '2011-06-22 00:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449873, 956858, 14476, '<td valign="top">Enter your comment here, and then cast //www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_vote_image.php?IMAGE_ID=956858#your vote...</td>', 'Enter your comment here, and then cast //www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_vote_image.php?IMAGE_ID=956858#your vote...', '2011-06-22 01:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6449969, 957613, 61666, '<td valign="top">fascinating</td>', 'fascinating', '2011-06-22 05:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450003, 957337, 61641, '<td valign="top">Would like to see more traffic, but guess you can''t control that.</td>', 'Would like to see more traffic, but guess you can''t control that.', '2011-06-22 08:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450004, 957560, 61641, '<td valign="top">Tilted?</td>', 'Tilted?', '2011-06-22 08:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450074, 957590, 114225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful black and white. While I''m sure this looks great in color, the B&amp;W gives this a nice classic feel.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: High. With that dark of skies your shutter definitely had to be open for a while.</td>', 'Beautiful black and white. While I''m sure this looks great in color, the B&W gives this a nice classic feel. Obvious tripod use: High. With that dark of skies your shutter definitely had to be open for a while.', '2011-06-22 09:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450076, 956923, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of blur. Actually it''s pretty cool for those that stop and think about it. With the nice sharp trunks and the moving branches it gives a sense of wind that is hard to capture in a photo.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: Medium-high. To me it''s obvious a tripod is needed, but I wonder if voters who are not really paying attention will miss the details here.</td>', 'Interesting use of blur. Actually it''s pretty cool for those that stop and think about it. With the nice sharp trunks and the moving branches it gives a sense of wind that is hard to capture in a photo. Obvious tripod use: Medium-high. To me it''s obvious a tripod is needed, but I wonder if voters who are not really paying attention will miss the details here.', '2011-06-22 09:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450078, 957626, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really like the separation of the background and foreground. Some may prefer a smoother out of focus area, but I think it provides extra character to the photo.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: Low. I spent a good chunk of time looking at this photo and trying to determine how a tripod was essential to the shot, but I couldn''t see that at all.</td>', 'I really like the separation of the background and foreground. Some may prefer a smoother out of focus area, but I think it provides extra character to the photo. Obvious tripod use: Low. I spent a good chunk of time looking at this photo and trying to determine how a tripod was essential to the shot, but I couldn''t see that at all.', '2011-06-22 09:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450079, 957649, 114225, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene with a nice feature to lead us into the water. I somewhat wish there were more stars visible in the sky.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: High.</td>', 'Lovely scene with a nice feature to lead us into the water. I somewhat wish there were more stars visible in the sky. Obvious tripod use: High.', '2011-06-22 09:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450081, 957620, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool use of light painting. Without the light streak in the background, this would have likely been a relatively boring photo to me. But that little touch makes a huge difference.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: Very high.</td>', 'Cool use of light painting. Without the light streak in the background, this would have likely been a relatively boring photo to me. But that little touch makes a huge difference. Obvious tripod use: Very high.', '2011-06-22 09:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450082, 957615, 119179, '<td valign="top">Absolutely brilliant ! Top mark !</td>', 'Absolutely brilliant ! Top mark !', '2011-06-22 09:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450084, 957284, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cute idea for the website. I find myself wishing the blue was brighter (more electric feeling).<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: High.</td>', 'Cute idea for the website. I find myself wishing the blue was brighter (more electric feeling). Obvious tripod use: High.', '2011-06-22 09:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450086, 957123, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m having a bit of trouble figuring out what I''m looking at. Is it a toy in front of the TV? Does the TV not have glass? I''m confused (not in a good or bad way, just confused).<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: Very low. With the lighting of this image, I''m not seeing how the use of a tripod is required forthe shot.</td>', 'I''m having a bit of trouble figuring out what I''m looking at. Is it a toy in front of the TV? Does the TV not have glass? I''m confused (not in a good or bad way, just confused). Obvious tripod use: Very low. With the lighting of this image, I''m not seeing how the use of a tripod is required forthe shot.', '2011-06-22 09:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450087, 957587, 119179, '<td valign="top">Awesome !</td>', 'Awesome !', '2011-06-22 09:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450089, 957618, 114225, '<td valign="top">You are lucky to have such a beautiful private place. I''m not super keen on the HDR in the trees. The harsh edges of the leaves are somewhat hurting my eyes. It does look nicer in the rocks.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: High.</td>', 'You are lucky to have such a beautiful private place. I''m not super keen on the HDR in the trees. The harsh edges of the leaves are somewhat hurting my eyes. It does look nicer in the rocks. Obvious tripod use: High.', '2011-06-22 09:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450092, 957588, 119179, '<td valign="top">Overuse of Topaz-like effects to me...</td>', 'Overuse of Topaz-like effects to me...', '2011-06-22 09:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450093, 957679, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool view of a typical spring storm. Just the colors and cloud formations bring a sense of urgency to find cover.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: Medium-high. With the time of day, I assume you needed a long shutter. But the uncertainty comes from the foliage being so sharp. With clouds like those I suspect it''s windy, so I''m surprised a long shutter isn''t showing a bunch of bluriness.</td>', 'Cool view of a typical spring storm. Just the colors and cloud formations bring a sense of urgency to find cover. Obvious tripod use: Medium-high. With the time of day, I assume you needed a long shutter. But the uncertainty comes from the foliage being so sharp. With clouds like those I suspect it''s windy, so I''m surprised a long shutter isn''t showing a bunch of bluriness.', '2011-06-22 09:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450094, 957633, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really find myself trying to figure out what this is. On the one hand, that''s fun as I kind of get to make up what the object is. On the other hand, I feel lost and confused.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: Medium. It''s really hard to tell if the object is moving or if the camera is moving.</td>', 'I really find myself trying to figure out what this is. On the one hand, that''s fun as I kind of get to make up what the object is. On the other hand, I feel lost and confused. Obvious tripod use: Medium. It''s really hard to tell if the object is moving or if the camera is moving.', '2011-06-22 09:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450095, 957447, 114225, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous setting and a very nice use of what looks like some light painting.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: Very high.</td>', 'Gorgeous setting and a very nice use of what looks like some light painting. Obvious tripod use: Very high.', '2011-06-22 09:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450096, 957501, 114225, '<td valign="top">I have seen a few of these images lately, and have consistently been impressed. In fact I thought I driving to a local airport to try to do something like this, but never got the time.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: Extremely high.</td>', 'I have seen a few of these images lately, and have consistently been impressed. In fact I thought I driving to a local airport to try to do something like this, but never got the time. Obvious tripod use: Extremely high.', '2011-06-22 09:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450098, 957604, 114225, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous setting. I want to transport myself to the shore and relax. I find it very interesting that the light casting down to the water seems to be creating a bit of an optical illusion and causing bumps in the water.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: High.</td>', 'Gorgeous setting. I want to transport myself to the shore and relax. I find it very interesting that the light casting down to the water seems to be creating a bit of an optical illusion and causing bumps in the water. Obvious tripod use: High.', '2011-06-22 09:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450099, 957333, 114225, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting, but what I find myself most concentrating on this shot is the object in the foreground. Specifically I''m trying to figure out what they are. Unfortunately, that distracts me from the rest of the beautiful scene.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: High.</td>', 'It''s interesting, but what I find myself most concentrating on this shot is the object in the foreground. Specifically I''m trying to figure out what they are. Unfortunately, that distracts me from the rest of the beautiful scene. Obvious tripod use: High.', '2011-06-22 09:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450101, 957672, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy the grittiness of the face.  Combine that with the shirt that looks like prison jumpsuit color, and a story starts to unfold.<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: Very low. I''m not saying you didn''t use a tripod, as this could very well be a self portrait, but there is absolutely no way of knowing that. With the bright lighting and definitely fast shutter speed (looking at the water), it''s impossible to tell that a tripod is required.</td>', 'I really enjoy the grittiness of the face.  Combine that with the shirt that looks like prison jumpsuit color, and a story starts to unfold. Obvious tripod use: Very low. I''m not saying you didn''t use a tripod, as this could very well be a self portrait, but there is absolutely no way of knowing that. With the bright lighting and definitely fast shutter speed (looking at the water), it''s impossible to tell that a tripod is required.', '2011-06-22 09:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6450105, 957596, 114225, '<td valign="top">Kind of a cool effect. Beyond the effect, I''m not seeing a lot of value in the image (I''m not trying to be mean, just being honest).<br/> <br/>Obvious tripod use: Medium. I assume this is done via light painting, but the gritty nature of the lines combined with the concentric circles makes it hard to tell if it is light painting or just some sort of object that is lit.</td>', 'Kind of a cool effect. Beyond the effect, I''m not seeing a lot of value in the image (I''m not trying to be mean, just being honest). Obvious tripod use: Medium. I assume this is done via light painting, but the gritty nature of the lines combined with the concentric circles makes it hard to tell if it is light painting or just some sort of object that is lit.', '2011-06-22 09:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
