(6451366, 957609, 124982, '<td valign="top">You know, I''ve tried my hardest here, but I just don''t get the connection to a tripod. If I saw blur on the hands of the watch, then I''d be good. But there''s nothing in this image that screams a tripod was used. Which is VERY unfortunate because I LOVE this image. Such simple, understated elegance. Love the negative space, and for once, I think the border actually does a lot to add to the image. Torn on how to vote, but decided to settle on a 7.</td>', 'You know, I''ve tried my hardest here, but I just don''t get the connection to a tripod. If I saw blur on the hands of the watch, then I''d be good. But there''s nothing in this image that screams a tripod was used. Which is VERY unfortunate because I LOVE this image. Such simple, understated elegance. Love the negative space, and for once, I think the border actually does a lot to add to the image. Torn on how to vote, but decided to settle on a 7.', '2011-06-24 00:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
