(6452451, 957331, 104230, '<td valign="top">Back to comment.  Lots to like here, great idea, great spinning top and circles of light. It meets the challenge.  On the other hand, I find it rather busy with the fence and tree cutting me off from what is most interesting rather than adding to the image.  Also, a small but "nagging" issue for me, I find the girl''s white sandals distracting because my eye keeps getting drawn back there.  On further reflection.. this nicely captures a child''s wonder with the spinning carousel, and the fence acts to provide the feeling of a child being on "the outside" looking "in" at where all the fun is going on. Perhaps a title to reflect that would have helped me appreciate the photo more immediately but I don''t know, it''s just a thought. I''m glad I took to time to explore it further.</td>', 'Back to comment.  Lots to like here, great idea, great spinning top and circles of light. It meets the challenge.  On the other hand, I find it rather busy with the fence and tree cutting me off from what is most interesting rather than adding to the image.  Also, a small but "nagging" issue for me, I find the girl''s white sandals distracting because my eye keeps getting drawn back there.  On further reflection.. this nicely captures a child''s wonder with the spinning carousel, and the fence acts to provide the feeling of a child being on "the outside" looking "in" at where all the fun is going on. Perhaps a title to reflect that would have helped me appreciate the photo more immediately but I don''t know, it''s just a thought. I''m glad I took to time to explore it further.', '2011-06-25 17:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6452510, 957662, 52336, '<td valign="top">Looks like a bspurgeon joint.  Crazy leading lines -- very appealing.  That little notch of dry land against the horizon at the right is curious and cool.</td>', 'Looks like a bspurgeon joint.  Crazy leading lines -- very appealing.  That little notch of dry land against the horizon at the right is curious and cool.', '2011-06-25 20:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
