(6452518, 957239, 117037, '<td valign="top">The pic is too busy...it''s better focused on the more attractive flying wheel on the left and shoot with a bit slower shutter to get more impact of motion, imho.</td>', 'The pic is too busy...it''s better focused on the more attractive flying wheel on the left and shoot with a bit slower shutter to get more impact of motion, imho.', '2011-06-25 20:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
