(6454375, 957660, 14476, '<td valign="top">Awww, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=100831" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">PennyStreet</a>, you was robbed!  Robbed, I say!<br/>I gave it a 7 because it was obvious that you needed a tripod plus you managed to find a moving red vehicle to make the complimentary colors zing.<br/> <br/>But we all wind up in the cellar once in a while.  You are in good company.</td>', 'Awww,  PennyStreet, you was robbed!  Robbed, I say!I gave it a 7 because it was obvious that you needed a tripod plus you managed to find a moving red vehicle to make the complimentary colors zing. But we all wind up in the cellar once in a while.  You are in good company.', '2011-06-27 20:20:39.000000', NULL, 0),
