(6454389, 956892, 109353, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sfalice:</b></div><hr/><i> Hey, Julien!  I just saw your lovely image and the name attached.<br/> <br/>Glad you are still having fun at DPC and hope all is well with you and yours.<br/> <br/>Can there be another DPL?  can we have the great team and friendship we all had once before?<br/> <br/>:) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Everything is good when travelling. I hope we could restart DPL with the same team we had before.<br/>Take care ;)</td>', 'Originally posted by sfalice: Hey, Julien!  I just saw your lovely image and the name attached. Glad you are still having fun at DPC and hope all is well with you and yours. Can there be another DPL?  can we have the great team and friendship we all had once before? :)  Everything is good when travelling. I hope we could restart DPL with the same team we had before.Take care ;)', '2011-06-27 20:32:30.000000', NULL, 0),
