(6457531, 957587, 106806, '<td valign="top">there we go again, typical Gyaban .... just a plain old long exposure shot of headlights - meh ....... transformed with extraordinary skill and attention to setting up the shot into WOW !!!!<br/> <br/>&gt;&gt;&gt;<br/> am honestly surprised about how well this picture does, I was expecting something around 6.3-6.5. <br/>&lt;&lt;&lt;<br/> <br/>Years ago I attended Teacher training college... I never finished - my tutor said "... you are good but you lack that indefinable something that makes a good teacher"<br/> <br/>You reminded me of that because well you are a good photographer but you HAVE that indefinable something that makes you an artist. There are a lot of photographers like that but what stands you out is the final piece of the Gyaban jigsaw the indefinable something to technicaly execute what you envision.</td>', 'there we go again, typical Gyaban .... just a plain old long exposure shot of headlights - meh ....... transformed with extraordinary skill and attention to setting up the shot into WOW !!!! >>> am honestly surprised about how well this picture does, I was expecting something around 6.3-6.5. <<< Years ago I attended Teacher training college... I never finished - my tutor said "... you are good but you lack that indefinable something that makes a good teacher" You reminded me of that because well you are a good photographer but you HAVE that indefinable something that makes you an artist. There are a lot of photographers like that but what stands you out is the final piece of the Gyaban jigsaw the indefinable something to technicaly execute what you envision.', '2011-07-01 06:21:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(6457544, 957587, 41142, '<td valign="top">Is there ever a week when you don''t win a ribbon? I am completely awed by your dedication (even on father''s day) combined with your never-ending creativity. =)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-07-01 06:03:25.</i></td>', 'Is there ever a week when you don''t win a ribbon? I am completely awed by your dedication (even on father''s day) combined with your never-ending creativity. =)', '2011-07-01 07:03:09.000000', '2011-07-01 07:03:25.000000', 0),
(6457706, 957462, 69325, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mgarsteck:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ccarter:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice shot deserving of the award - but expected more then a yellow? A bit arrogant I''d say. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Like Levt said, hoping is a better word.  If you dont shoot for the best and have high expectations for your work then your work will not <br/>improve as quickly.  I want to be the best and so I shoot like it, and that mentality has done me well in my professional career.<br/> <br/>This is literally my favorite picture that I have taken so far, I only want the best for it, I take a lot of pride in them, just like they are my kids or something.<br/> <br/>And Yes Deb, I like the birds as well, its the cherry on top for me.  I dont know if they were sleeping or not but thats my best assumption.  I would like to come back to this town, it was a lot of fun. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No matter what you say, you''ll always offend <i>someone</i>, you go with your bad self :)</td>', 'Originally posted by mgarsteck: Originally posted by ccarter: Nice shot deserving of the award - but expected more then a yellow? A bit arrogant I''d say.   Like Levt said, hoping is a better word.  If you dont shoot for the best and have high expectations for your work then your work will not improve as quickly.  I want to be the best and so I shoot like it, and that mentality has done me well in my professional career. This is literally my favorite picture that I have taken so far, I only want the best for it, I take a lot of pride in them, just like they are my kids or something. And Yes Deb, I like the birds as well, its the cherry on top for me.  I dont know if they were sleeping or not but thats my best assumption.  I would like to come back to this town, it was a lot of fun.   No matter what you say, you''ll always offend someone, you go with your bad self :)', '2011-07-01 11:08:42.000000', NULL, 0),
