(7152605, 957152, 66267, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ti_evom:</b></div><hr/><i> Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 5<br/>A good telephoto lens with a high ISO, handheld?  It''s possible.  Star trails with the moon would have been a dead giveaway. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>HOW COULD YOU HAVE START TRAILS WITH THE MOON, MAN. YOU CAN''TTTTTTTTTTTT.</td>', 'Originally posted by ti_evom: Obvious use of a tripod, or any other long-term stabilization tool (1-10 *is not the score of the shot though*): 5A good telephoto lens with a high ISO, handheld?  It''s possible.  Star trails with the moon would have been a dead giveaway.   HOW COULD YOU HAVE START TRAILS WITH THE MOON, MAN. YOU CAN''TTTTTTTTTTTT.', '2014-01-06 01:26:52.000000', NULL, 0);
